# Fetched sources. The site pages belong to erdosproblems.com, the papers are copyright their authors, OEIS content is CC BY-SA 4.0 and the formal-conjectures files are Apache-2.0, so nothing retrieved is redistributed here. `sh refs/fetch.sh` repopulates the directory; see refs/README.md.
refs/*
!refs/README.md
!refs/fetch.sh

# Lean build outputs and the fetched Lean packages (Mathlib, formal-conjectures and their dependencies); `lake build` in lean/ recreates them.
lean/.lake/

# Log written by the fetch stage of scripts/reproduce.sh.
results/fetch.log

__pycache__/

# Local environment files can hold credentials; committed templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
!.env.sample
